@startuml Maintenance Task Lifecycle
title Figure X: Maintenance Task Status State Machine Diagram

' Professional State Diagram Styling
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #f0f7ff
    BorderColor #0078d4
    ArrowColor #0078d4
    FontSize 12
}
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10

[*] --> Pending : addNewTask()
note on link: Initial status is 'pending'

state Pending {
    [*] --> Active
    Active --> Overdue : Automated refresh\n(Due Date passed)
    Active : Waiting for maintenance\nperformance
}

state Completed {
    Completed : Task logged in history\nNext due date calculated
}

state Overdue {
    Overdue : Urgent attention required\nHighlighted in Red
}

Pending --> Completed : completeTask()
note right: Manual action by operator

Overdue --> Completed : completeTask()
note right: Manual action by operator

Completed --> Pending : Automated refresh\n(Within 3 days of Next Due)

Completed --> Overdue : Automated refresh\n(Next Due Date passed)

@enduml
